  keys are real holes rather than dark shapes painted on top - that is what lets
  the themed (monochrome) icon show the keypad instead of a solid slab.

  The body is warm white and one key is operation orange, mirroring what the app
  actually looks like: a neutral keypad with a single accented key. The icon was
  still cyan and violet from the palette this app had before the redesign.
  Everything sits inside the 66dp safe circle of the 108dp adaptive canvas.
-->
